      * In-program suite: the tests run INSIDE a copy of INVOICE, with
      * access to its WORKING-STORAGE and PERFORM of its paragraphs. A
      * MOCK applies only in the case that declares it.
       TESTSUITE TSTINV 'Invoicing (in-program on INVOICE)'
       PROGRAM INVOICE

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CAPTURED               PIC X(80).
       01  WS-CAPT-COUNT             PIC 9(3).

       BEFORE-EACH
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-TOTAL WS-READ-COUNT WS-LINE-COUNT
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-CAPT-COUNT
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-CAPTURED
           MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
       END-BEFORE

       TESTCASE 'one line calculated with the real DISCOUNT'
           MOVE 2000 TO WS-C-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 2100-CALC
           EXPECT WS-NET TO BE NUMERIC 1600
           EXPECT WS-CATEGORY TO BE 'PREMIUM'
           EXPECT WS-TOTAL TO BE NUMERIC 1600
           VERIFY CALL 'DISCOUNT' HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'calculation with DISCOUNT mocked'
           MOCK CALL 'DISCOUNT'
               MOVE 999 TO WS-NET
               MOVE 'MOCKED' TO WS-CATEGORY
           END-MOCK
           MOVE 2000 TO WS-C-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 2100-CALC
           EXPECT WS-NET TO BE NUMERIC 999
           EXPECT WS-CATEGORY TO BE 'MOCKED'
           VERIFY CALL 'DISCOUNT' HAPPENED 1 TIMES

       TESTCASE 'the mock of the previous case does not affect this one'
           MOVE 100 TO WS-C-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 2100-CALC
           EXPECT WS-CATEGORY TO BE 'BASIC'
           VERIFY CALL 'DISCOUNT' HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'full process with mocked files'
           MOCK FILE CUST-FILE
               ON READ
                   EVALUATE CBLT-READ-COUNT
                       WHEN 1
                           MOVE "C001ACME      000200000" TO CUST-REC
                       WHEN 2
                           MOVE "C002BETA      000050000" TO CUST-REC
                       WHEN OTHER
                           SET CBLT-AT-END TO TRUE
                   END-EVALUATE
           END-MOCK
           MOCK FILE REPORT-FILE
               ON WRITE
                   ADD 1 TO WS-CAPT-COUNT
                   MOVE REPORT-REC TO WS-CAPTURED
           END-MOCK
           PERFORM 2000-PROCESS
           EXPECT WS-READ-COUNT TO BE NUMERIC 2
           EXPECT WS-LINE-COUNT TO BE NUMERIC 2
           EXPECT WS-CAPT-COUNT TO BE NUMERIC 2
           EXPECT WS-TOTAL TO BE NUMERIC 2050
           EXPECT WS-CAPTURED TO CONTAIN 'BETA'
           EXPECT WS-CAPTURED TO CONTAIN 'STANDARD'
           EXPECT WS-CUST-STATUS TO BE '10'
           VERIFY PARAGRAPH 2100-CALC HAPPENED 2 TIMES
           VERIFY READ CUST-FILE HAPPENED 3 TIMES
           VERIFY WRITE REPORT-FILE HAPPENED 2 TIMES
           VERIFY CALL 'DISCOUNT' HAPPENED AT LEAST 2 TIMES
           VERIFY PARAGRAPH 3000-END NEVER HAPPENED

       TESTCASE 'initialization with mocked clock and files'
           MOCK CLOCK
               DATE '251102'
           END-MOCK
           MOCK FILE CUST-FILE
           END-MOCK
           MOCK FILE REPORT-FILE
               ON WRITE
                   MOVE REPORT-REC TO WS-CAPTURED
           END-MOCK
           PERFORM 1000-INIT
           EXPECT WS-DATE TO BE NUMERIC 251102
           EXPECT WS-CAPTURED TO CONTAIN 'INVOICING   251102'
           EXPECT WS-REP-STATUS TO BE '00'
           VERIFY OPEN CUST-FILE HAPPENED ONCE
           VERIFY WRITE REPORT-FILE HAPPENED ONCE
           VERIFY PARAGRAPH 2500-WRITE-HEADER HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'mocked paragraph: the original does not run'
           MOCK PARAGRAPH 2100-CALC
               MOVE 5 TO WS-NET
               ADD WS-NET TO WS-TOTAL
           END-MOCK
           MOVE 2000 TO WS-C-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 2100-CALC
           PERFORM 2100-CALC
           EXPECT WS-NET TO BE NUMERIC 5
           EXPECT WS-TOTAL TO BE NUMERIC 10
           VERIFY PARAGRAPH 2100-CALC HAPPENED 2 TIMES
           VERIFY CALL 'DISCOUNT' NEVER HAPPENED

       TESTCASE 'mocked read in a single paragraph'
           MOCK FILE CUST-FILE
               ON READ AT END
           END-MOCK
           PERFORM 2010-READ-CUST
           EXPECT WS-END-OF-FILE TO BE TRUE
           EXPECT WS-READ-COUNT TO BE ZEROS
           VERIFY READ CUST-FILE HAPPENED NO MORE THAN 1 TIMES

       IGNORE
       TESTCASE 'pending: close with a file error'
           PERFORM 3000-END
           EXPECT WS-CUST-STATUS TO BE '00'
